## 1. Read-Only CLI Verification Gates (`PASS` / `FAIL` / `NOT_RUN`)

| Check | Command | Gate |
|---|---|---|
| **Caller & Symbol Search** | `{{caller_search_cmd}}` | Read-only trace |
| **Static Analysis / Typecheck** | `{{typecheck_cmd}}` | `PASS` / `FAIL` |
| **Focused Test Execution** | `{{test_cmd}}` | `PASS` / `FAIL` |

## 2. The Hunt Loop

1. **Fix the scope & read callers:** Record `BASE_REVISION..REVIEW_REVISION`, read each changed hunk in its full enclosing unit, and inspect all callers of changed public symbols ([01 — Scope, Dimensions & Patterns]({{ref_01}})).
2. **Cold pass through 7 dimensions:** Walk the code before reading specs/designs; write candidates as `file:line — hypothesis` ([01 — Scope, Dimensions & Patterns]({{ref_01}})).
3. **Adversarial disproof:** Trace the real execution path from entry point to line; keep only candidates with a concrete `given → when → then` scenario and read-only evidence ([02 — Verify & Disprove]({{ref_02}})).
4. **Rank, cap & report:** Grade with `BLOCKER` / `MAJOR` / `MINOR` and `CONFIRMED` / `PLAUSIBLE`; end with the `bug-hunt:` summary line ([03 — Severity, Verdict & Report]({{ref_03}})).
5. **Apply verdict & role duties:** Enforce verdict impact (`APPROVED` / `REQUEST_CHANGES` / `BLOCKED`) and role boundaries ([03 — Severity, Verdict & Report]({{ref_03}})).

